WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.170
All four ranked Roborock first.

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.190
But their shopping picks were different.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.870
In RecoScope’s November 16
robot vacuum benchmark,

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.910
Roborock appeared in all 12
usable answers.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.410
Every comparative answer
ranked it first.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.630
In the open recommendation prompt,

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.390
ChatGPT and Gemini
led with Roborock.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:19.830
Claude picked Shark.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:21.710
Perplexity picked MOVA.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:23.050
Same household:

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.950
two floors, two kids
and a long-haired cat.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.330
Three prompt types:

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:30.450
discovery, under $500, and ranking.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.170
Roborock appeared in
every budget answer,

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.750
while Eufy appeared in three.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.410
Those mentions don’t verify
a checkout price under $500.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:42.330
A first-place brand is not one
agreed product recommendation.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:46.410
These findings describe captured
answers, not product quality.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.410
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
